<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2983" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ăpertĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an
				opening</i>, <i>unfolding</i> (only ante- and
			post-class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>a.</b> With <i>gen.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">floris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. 1, 6, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">templi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 11, p. 266, 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Eccli. 20, 15</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">ib. Ephes. 6,
			19</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cum periculo introitur recenti apertione,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1</span></i>
			,  63: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">apertio,</span>”
				<i>the solemn opening of a temple</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Serv. ad Verg. A. 4, 301</span></i>
			.</div>
